  <cac:TenderingProcess>
    <cbc:Description languageID="ENG">The procurement note has been published on the website www.hankintailmoitukset.fi and http://ted.europa.eu. The procurement will be carried out in accordance with the Public Procurement Act (1397/2016) and the Public Procurement Directive 2014/24/EU. The procurement will be carried out as an EU procurement, using the open procurement procedure.

The procurement procedure will be carried out in stages as follows:

1. Opening of tenders and verification of the eligibility of tenderers
2. Verification of the conformity of the tenders with the call for tenders
3. Comparison of tenders
4. Adoption of the procurement award decision and notification of the decision
5. Conclusion of an agreement with the winner of the tender</cbc:Description>
    <cbc:ProcedureCode listName="procurement-procedure-type">open</cbc:ProcedureCode>
